@startuml 3.8.7 - Track Post Status
title Sequence Diagram — 3.8.7 - Track Post Status

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

' === Participants ===
actor "Creator / Manager" as creatormanager
entity "PostStatusTrackingResponse" as poststatustrackingre
entity "PostMongoRepository" as postmongorepository
control "PostServiceImpl" as postserviceimpl
boundary "PostController" as postcontroller
boundary "PostStatusBadge / TrackingModal (UI)" as poststatusbadgetrack

' === Flow ===
creatormanager -> poststatusbadgetrack: Click "View Publishing Status" on Post card
poststatusbadgetrack -> postcontroller: GET /api/v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/posts/{postId}/status
postcontroller -> postserviceimpl: getPostPublishStatus(workspaceId, postId)
postserviceimpl -> postmongorepository: findByIdAndWorkspaceId(postId, workspaceId)
postmongorepository --> postserviceimpl: return PostDocument (status, failReason, updatedAt, targetPlatforms)
postserviceimpl -> postserviceimpl: mapToStepperProgress(postDoc.getStatus())
postserviceimpl -> poststatustrackingre: new PostStatusTrackingResponse(status, currentStep, failReason, targetPlatforms, updatedAt)
poststatustrackingre --> postserviceimpl: return trackingData
postserviceimpl --> postcontroller: return trackingData
postcontroller --> poststatusbadgetrack: return 200 OK (ApiResponse { data: trackingData })
poststatusbadgetrack --> creatormanager: Render status stepper badge (Pending → In Progress → Done / Fail)

@enduml
